		{
			"id": "tGQONCSJD2MRXRoF0",
			"name": "Witch-sight",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The first, mildest sign of the gift: an unlearned, passive prickling sense of daemonic taint, psychic activity, and warp corruption — how unsanctioned psykers are so often found, and how veteran Inquisitors and Space Marines notice a place has gone wrong before anything visible happens. Widely depicted; no single canonical source, consistent across Black Library and Dark Heresy-line material alike.\n\nDesign: Built as Detect (Psychic Activity & Daemonic Taint), an uncommon but not vanishingly rare category, base 10 per Basic's Detect cost table (B47-48). No Perils of the Warp: it is involuntary background sense, not a deliberate act of channelling.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Mental",
				"Psyker",
				"Imperium"
			],
			"modifiers": [
				{
					"id": "mOy_vSsWOYpH9WFS2",
					"name": "Warp",
					"cost_adj": "-15%"
				}
			],
			"base_points": 10
		},
		{
			"id": "Tb4pyfZmUEeU3gBZS",
			"name": "Telepathy",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Reading, sending, and overwhelming minds. Calibrated against Dark Heresy's Telepathy list (Mind Probe, Dominate, Psychic Scream, Terrify, Invisibility-adjacent Mental Interrogation) and the astropathic relay seen throughout Black Library whenever a ship needs to send word home.\n\nDesign: Talent-linked group; see each child.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Mental",
				"Psyker",
				"Imperium"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "T3Dd9f5hkP1G7kSKq",
					"name": "Mind Probe/Dominate",
					"local_notes": "Lore: The same intrusion into another mind, bought at two intensities: a forced reading of buried memory, or outright control of the body.\n\nDesign: Alternative_abilities container; full price for the costlier Dominate plus a fifth of Mind Probe.",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Mental",
						"Psyker",
						"Imperium"
					],
					"container_type": "alternative_abilities",
					"children": [
						{
							"id": "teohM2Lil-bPfWCfy",
							"name": "Mind Probe",
							"local_notes": "Lore: Tears buried memories and secrets from an unwilling subject.\n\nDesign: Mind Probe, Basic's core advantage, flat 20, with Warp/Perils.",
							"tags": [
								"Advantage",
								"Mental",
								"Psyker",
								"Imperium"
