					"name": "Psychic Scream",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A silent, mind-shattering shout that stuns everyone nearby.\n\nDesign: Affliction (10/level, delivering the default Stun effect) with Area Effect (+50%) plus Warp/Perils.",
